4. Prospects for the future
How likely is it that the new statistics institute will fulfil the functions intended? The answer is not certain. There are several possible explanations for the inability of UNESCO to keep abreast of the changes in statistical services, and these may be relevant to determining the future of the statistics institute. One explanation is the fact that reliable
